OL,3,GNEWSAFuneral of mum and three children
OL,4,Akilled in house fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 100 people gathered for the
OL,7,Ffuneral of a mother and three of her
OL,8,Fchildren killed in a house fire.
OL,10,FElisha Brabin, 36, and her children
OL,11,FLeo, 16, Ellis, eight, and
OL,12,Fseven-year-old Prudence died after a
OL,13,Fblaze spread through their home in
OL,14,FBootle, Merseyside, in the early hours
OL,15,Fof 22 September.
OL,17,FTheir coffins - white for Elisha,
OL,18,Fpurple for Leo and Ellis and pink for
OL,19,FPrudence - were each brought to the
OL,20,FThornton Garden of Rest by horse-drawn
OL,21,Ffuneral carriages.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
